<title>INDIA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY EIGHT WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA BEAT AUSTRALIA BY EIGHT WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>GUWAHATI, India 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa beat</p>
<p>Australia by eight wickets in the Titan Cup triangular one-day</p>
<p>limited-overs series on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 238-6 (50 overs); South Africa 239-2 (45</p>
<p>overs).</p>
</text>
